    {
      "id": "calendar.availability",
      "title": "Free time",
      "description": "Free/busy and bookable slots. `truncated` is rendered as a visible warning above the slots — a degraded answer that does not say it is degraded would offer already-booked time with total confidence — and an empty slots[] is named as 'no windows are set', never as 'nothing free'.",
