    {
      "id": "calendar.delete-event",
      "title": "Delete event",
      "description": "The destructive verb, confirmed on a bottom sheet on a phone (never a popover under somebody's thumb) with a confirm button that NAMES the action instead of saying OK. Deleting one time in a series is a different consequence from deleting a standalone event, so it is a different sentence.",
