        "event-cancelled"
      ],
      "source": "demo/RsvpControl.demo.tsx"
    },
    {
      "id": "calendar.screen",
      "title": "Calendar",
      "description": "The wired month/week/day screen. The canned range deliberately contains a materialized occurrence in BOTH events[] and occurrences[] — the duplicate the module's contract warns about — plus a cancelled row, so the shot proves the dedup and the tombstone arm rather than asserting them. Below the grid's minimum element width it becomes the agenda; the geometry is the box's, never the viewport's.",
      "component": "Calendar",
